  "title": "Apple Butter Spice Cake",
  "description": "This apple butter spice cake recipe features apple butter, sour cream, and wholesome bran cereal, crowned with a warm-spiced, brown sugar–pecan topping.",
  "authors": [
    "shirley"
  ],
